her whole name."},{"s":23.875,"e":27.711,"text":"You can talk all day, you can act real slick,"},{"s":27.711,"e":31.546,"text":"you can stretch, warm up, pick your perfect grip,"},{"s":31.546,"e":36.533,"text":"but when the pins start shaking and the scoreboard glows,"},{"s":36.533,"e":41.52,"text":"everybody in the alley already knows—"},{"s":41.52,"e":46.123,"text":"Danny’s gonna beat you at bowling anyway,"},{"s":46.123,"e":50.342,"text":"strike in the tenth like she planned it all day."},{"s":50.342,"e":53.411,"text":"Rolls that thunder straight down the lane,"},{"s":53.411,"e":57.63,"text":"leaves your ego in the gutter again."},{"s":57.63,"e":59.931,"text":"Doesn’t matter what you thought,"},{"s":59.931,"e":62.233,"text":"doesn’t matter what they say,"},{"s":62.233,"e":66.836,"text":"Danny’s gonna beat you at bowling anyway."},{"s":66.836,"e":69.521,"text":"She’s got that quiet confidence,"},{"s":69.521,"e":71.822,"text":"that “watch this” kind of grin,"},{"s":71.822,"e":74.891,"text":"like she’s already heard the doubts"},{"s":74.891,"e":77.576,"text":"and turned them into wins."},{"s":77.576,"e":80.645,"text":"You see a challenge, she sees rhythm,"},{"s":80.645,"e":83.33,"text":"you see limits, she sees aim,"},{"s":83.33,"e":87.166,"text":"and by frame five you’re reconsidering"},{"s":87.166,"e":89.851,"text":"why you ever played this game."},{"s":89.851,"e":93.686,"text":"So raise up a soda, raise up a cheer,"},{"s":93.686,"e":98.289,"text":"for Danielle with the cannon arm, calm and clear."},{"s":98.289,"e":102.125,"text":"Life threw curves, but she learned the spin,"},{"s":102.125,"e":106.728,"text":"now she’s picking up spares with a champion grin."},{"s":106.728,"e":107.879,"text":"Final Hook"},{"s":107.879,"e":112.482,"text":"Danny’s gonna beat you at bowling anyway,"},{"s":112.482,"e":115.167,"text":"left pin, right pin, all gone, hey."},{"s":115.167,"e":119.77,"text":"Call it heart, call it skill, call it family pride,"},{"s":119.77,"e":123.606,"text":"she’s got the whole damn alley on her side."},{"s":123.606,"e":125.907,"text":"Doesn’t matter what you thought,"},{"s":125.907,"e":128.209,"text":"doesn’t matter what they say,"},{"s":128.209,"e":132.812,"text":"Danny’s gonna beat you at bowling anyway."},{"s":132.812,"e":137.415,"text":"So don’t judge the story by the first line written,"},{"s":137.415,"e":142.018,"text":"don’t bet against Danny when the lanes are lit."},{"s":142.018,"e":146.237,"text":"Spina bifida doesn’t get the final say—"},{"s":146.237,"e":150.84,"text":"Danny’s gonna beat you at bowling anyway."}],"duration":161.52,"source":"curated-realigned","generatedAt":"2026-08-21T00:55:13.860Z","realignedFrom":"whisper-aligned","vocalStart":0.86,"vocalEnd":150.84}